 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Weather expressions",
     "texto": [
      "**Este cald** means «it's hot» and **este frig**, «it's cold». **Plouă** («it rains») and **ninge** («it snows») are impersonal expressions: unlike in English, they do not need a subject word such as «it»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement",
     "texto": [
      "**Vreme** («weather») is feminine. That is why we say **vreme frumoasă** («nice weather»), with the feminine adjective **frumoasă**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
